   "detailed_description": "<h1>加入推薦中文discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/2ac17a2396df011b28b57779c480ac31.poster.avif?t=1792078032\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/2ac17a2396df011b28b57779c480ac31.webm?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/2ac17a2396df011b28b57779c480ac31.mp4?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>歡迎參與“亞洲內容創作者與主播招募”獲取支持與獎勵。點此查看詳情<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/79b63fae4b81d78b937a377f1e8140d3.avif?t=1792078032\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p></p><br><h1>關於此遊戲</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>化身焰生者並崛起</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你甦醒時將化為墮落王國的最後希望。透過有深度的技能樹打造你的英雄——重甲巨無霸、致命遊俠、強大的戰鬥法師，或結合全部來打造你的專屬玩法。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/f6027a9d2efe7341ee68b2c0e875a8f1.poster.avif?t=1792078032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/f6027a9d2efe7341ee68b2c0e875a8f1.webm?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/f6027a9d2efe7341ee68b2c0e875a8f1.mp4?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>探索廣闊而美麗的荒野</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索令人驚艷的風景與失落文明的秘密。穿越蒼翠森林、炙熱沙丘、白皚的山峰，以及被霧幕吞噬的廢墟。用抓鉤擺盪越過深淵，從令人暈眩的高處滑翔而下，潛入水底，並前往道路永遠無法抵達的秘境。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/003d8714fdc57b2601f120f26be476f4.poster.avif?t=1792078032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/003d8714fdc57b2601f120f26be476f4.webm?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/003d8714fdc57b2601f120f26be476f4.mp4?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>生存與成長</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >靠這片土地生活——狩獵、耕種、釣魚，並蒐集稀有材料。從霧幕中解救倖存者，你孤獨的小屋將逐漸變成充滿工匠與居民的聚落，並解鎖全新的配方與裝備。在這裡，做好準備與創意是生存的關鍵。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/e79b67669887c11b18149f39311063ff.poster.avif?t=1792078032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/e79b67669887c11b18149f39311063ff.webm?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/e79b67669887c11b18149f39311063ff.mp4?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>找出你的戰鬥風格</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >變強後，你才能面對那些追殺你的東西。揮舞巨劍、施放毀天滅地的魔法；透過易學難精的技能戰鬥與天賦系統，來專注於一個職業，或混搭不同的類型。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/31e6123c4558233e2dd5ce54f131c86b.poster.avif?t=1792078032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/31e6123c4558233e2dd5ce54f131c86b.webm?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/31e6123c4558233e2dd5ce54f131c86b.mp4?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>無拘無束地建造</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在餘火之谷佔據屬於你的一席之地——只要你能想像出來，你就能建造出來。蓋出聳立的堡壘、在山壁中鑿出你的房子、改變整個地貌，並細細裝飾每個房間。此立體像素建造系統提供你不可思議的自由，讓你能將這個世界變成你的家園。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/b7ee7f9d55b7425fcd00c27dfebc5de5.poster.avif?t=1792078032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/b7ee7f9d55b7425fcd00c27dfebc5de5.webm?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/b7ee7f9d55b7425fcd00c27dfebc5de5.mp4?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>征服霧幕</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >向敵人展開反擊。深入威脅所有生命的致命迷霧。面對最恐怖的生物，取得其他地方找不到的稀有材料，並從霧幕的控制中救出餘火之谷。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/870186393391e3f40602602bc6efacd1.poster.avif?t=1792078032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/870186393391e3f40602602bc6efacd1.webm?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/870186393391e3f40602602bc6efacd1.mp4?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>打造你的傳奇——單人或與好友一同皆可</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >獨自踏上這條路，或是與最多 16 名玩家一起合作。戰鬥、建造、耕種、探索：在重建王國時，所有角色都非常重要。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/8fb3f236662088659545a154c900a43d.poster.avif?t=1792078032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/8fb3f236662088659545a154c900a43d.webm?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/8fb3f236662088659545a154c900a43d.mp4?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>無限的冒險等你來探索</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >戰役結束時，你的故事並未告終。進入數百萬名玩家創造的世界與地牢，或透過我們的冒險分享功能來分享你自己的創作。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/f43914c8aa76d18500ff6e42f92538e3.poster.avif?t=1792078032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/f43914c8aa76d18500ff6e42f92538e3.webm?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/f43914c8aa76d18500ff6e42f92538e3.mp4?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
